Exact accumulation for OpenCPMD. Default off (-D__EXACT_ACC).
Against 062582b7cfd832d36f88f504cd08e4ead42eb404.

Already-global sums must not be added again.
exact_note_skip tells the next in-place real8 mp_sum, or summat, to
return. exact_fnl_consume does the same for sumfnl, including the
one-rank return, so a mark is not left for a later sum.

